  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-13T03:11:36.852123Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-18T22:36:22.537342Z",
  "totalBlocks": 17,
  "translatedBlocks": 14,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3769844f74fc5d5e",
      "translationZh": "预填充步长既会影响 PP 性能，也会影响草稿模型为 MTP 获取 logits（也会影响 dflash；需要对 mlx-vlm 做少量修补，才能支持 dflash 的分块预填充）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d240a034995efd2",
      "translationZh": "它还需要足够大，才能充分利用所有核心，但又不能超出核心的承载能力，否则就会需要更多次调度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a535de88d9b5437b",
      "translationZh": "在我的测试中，我观察到步长增至 8k 的过程中有很大的性能提升，例如：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "709a58ad6fe64d72",
      "translationZh": "在未经修改的 mlx-vlm 上，GLM-flash-4bit 使用 MTP，设置 --prefill-step-size 8192：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "06071024ea6acf68",
      "translationZh": "试验 1（32768 个提示词 token）：prompt_tps=1056.033, generation_tps=72.722, total_time=38.082",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "45f72dce7d6281db",
      "translationZh": "试验 2（65536 个提示词 token）：prompt_tps=919.958, generation_tps=73.671, total_time=78.203",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d263299b96fe4a6f",
      "translationZh": "试验 3（131072 个提示词 token）：prompt_tps=735.545, generation_tps=71.067, total_time=185.435",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ead58dcac4efb4a",
      "translationZh": "GLM-flash-4bit 使用 MTP，设置 --prefill-step-size 2048：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9bd61665f4db1267",
      "translationZh": "试验 1（32768 个提示词元）：prompt_tps=860.489, generation_tps=50.011, total_time=48.339",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a160056d6faf5ac",
      "translationZh": "试验 2（65536 个提示词元）：prompt_tps=785.604, generation_tps=51.245, total_time=93.425",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e64f29bcff90d0f",
      "translationZh": "试验 3（131072 个提示词元）：prompt_tps=623.588, generation_tps=50.843, total_time=220.288",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "781b2852340fe9a9",
      "translationZh": "启用 MTP 的 omlx（总时间存在偏差，因为这里是 128TG，而上面是 512）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9dfd40f0a01600d",
      "translationZh": "请注意，有些引擎（例如 omlx）支持自适应步长。例如，我观察到 qwen3.8-flash-next 在 omlx 上的预填充速度，尽管步长从 2048 开始，但在 64k 及以上的上下文长度下，仍能达到原生 mlx-vlm 使用 8k 步长时的性能，在较短的上下文下甚至还要好 10%，不过正如你所见，情况并非总是如此。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0b73a94e93b6dac",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/bakawolf123 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
